/div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32335,32091,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32335, 32091, 7)</a></div></center></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Male</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Clairvoyant</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">11.02.4128<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 6, 2016<br/>Winter Update 2016</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20221213214521&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Albinius_497108.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Albinius.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Walk in the light of Shaper wisdom!</li><li>Our ways are the ways of the Shapers.</li><li>Welcome, my child.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>The <a href=\"#/wiki/Halls%20of%20Hope\">Halls of Hope</a>, north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>You can give him <a href=\"#/wiki/Heavy%20Old%20Tome\">Heavy Old Tomes</a> in order to contribute in the rebuilding of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Halls%20of%20Hope\">Halls of Hope</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buys\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buys\">Buys</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th></th><th>Item</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Heavy%20Old%20Tome\"><img alt=\"Heavy Old Tome\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Heavy_Old_Tome_c6f6a9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Heavy%20Old%20Tome\">Heavy Old Tome</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">30 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-sells\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sells\">Sells</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th></th><th>Item</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Blank%20Imbuement%20Scroll\"><img alt=\"Blank Imbuement Scroll\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blank_Imbuement_Scroll_77fffd.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Blank%20Imbuement%20Scroll\">Blank Imbuement Scroll</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">25,000 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Albinius.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\nAlbinius: Greetings, pilgrim. Welcome to the halls of hope. We are the keepers of this {temple} and welcome everyone willing to contribute.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>temple</b><br/>\nAlbinius: The temple has been restored to its former glory, yet we strife to live and praise in the {Shaper} ways. Do you still need me to take some old {tomes} from you my child?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>tomes</b><br/>\nAlbinius: The {Shapers} have been eager to share and document their wisdom in any way possible. They knew many ways of preserving information, some of them probably not yet known to or even understandable by us ...<br/>\nAlbinius: Right now the most helpful records of the {Shapers} are the various tomes they wrote. You may still find some of them in the vicinity of Thais, some locked away in old chests, others robbed by feral creatures. ...<br/>\nAlbinius: They surely use them for terrible profane purposes so getting them back would be a service to the Shapers. Furthermore these tomes might contain everything we need to finish the {temple}.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Shapers</b><br/>\nAlbinius: The Shapers were an advanced civilisation, well versed in art, construction, language and exploration of our world in their time. ...<br/>\nAlbinius: The foundations of this temple are testament to their genius and advanced understanding of complex problems. They were master craftsmen and excelled in magic.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>name</b><br/>\nAlbinius: I am Albinius, a worshipper of the {Astral Shapers}.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>job</b><br/>\nAlbinius: I find ways to unveil the secrets of the stars. Judging by this question, I doubt you follow my weekly publications concerning this research.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>time</b><br/>\nAlbinius: Precisely <i>time</i>.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>astral shaper rune</b><br/>\nAlbinius: Do you wish to merge your rune parts into an astral shaper rune?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>yes</b><br/>\nAlbinius: As you wish.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>trade</b><br/>\nAlbinius: Surely. I sell blank imbuement scrolls and etchers, but you can also sell tomes to me if you have any. Please take a look at my offers.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\nAlbinius: Farewell, my child.<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Albinius</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["forgotten-knowledge-quest","opticording-sphere-quest"],"pos":{"x":32335,"y":32091,"z":7}}